    "@value" : "Tyre class C3: tyres designed primarily for heavy-duty vehicles, such as trucks and buses. Value of eudpp:hasProductGroup for a tyre."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
