    "@value" : "Serialised GTIN: a GTIN combined with a serial number, identifying one individual trade item; here in the EPC pure identity URN form (urn:epc:id:sgtin:...). Used with granularity eudpp:item. Local scheme until the CORE IDENT module provides one."
